### 查询全部
GET http://localhost:8080/employee/selectAll

### 按 id 查询（路径参数）
GET http://localhost:8080/employee/selectById/1

### 按 id 查询（@Select 注解方式）
GET http://localhost:8080/employee/selectOne?id=1

### 分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/employee/selectPage?pageNum=1&pageSize=2

### 新增
POST http://localhost:8080/employee/insert
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "王五",
  "sex": "男",
  "no": "100004",
  "age": 24,
  "description": "新员工测试"
}

### 修改（id 必须是已经存在的记录）
PUT http://localhost:8080/employee/update
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "王五",
  "sex": "男",
  "no": "100004",
  "age": 25,
  "description": "修改后的描述"
}

### 删除
DELETE http://localhost:8080/employee/delete/4
